o run only the Slowloris NSE script (instead of the entire vuln category), use:

nmap -Pn -sV -p 6165 --script http-slowloris-check iapp192625.heathrow.ms.com

Or save the output to a file:

nmap -Pn -sV -p 6165 --script http-slowloris-check -oN slowloris.txt iapp192625.heathrow.ms.com
Increase verbosity (shows more details)
nmap -Pn -sV -p 6165 --script http-slowloris-check -d iapp192625.heathrow.ms.com

or

nmap -Pn -sV -p 6165 --script http-slowloris-check -vv iapp192625.heathrow.ms.com
